| B | n/a (no tripwire line in any boot) |

That count is meaningful only for an arm whose kernel prints tripwire lines (step 1b, e211d6d, or later); an arm with no tripwire line in any boot shows n/a. INCONCLUSIVE boots (no kernel result) are never counted.

No boot has a complete `v=1` tripwire line.

